> model m { iadd: 1, fadd: 1 }
> model n : m { fmul: 2 }
> model m : n { fdiv: 3 }
> use m
cost model: m
> cost x*x + y
cost of x*x + y under m: 3 (2 operations, shared subterms counted once)
  fadd             1 x 1     = 1
  fmul             1 x 2     = 2
> use n
cost model: n
> cost x*x + y
cost of x*x + y under n: 3 (2 operations, shared subterms counted once)
  fadd             1 x 1     = 1
  fmul             1 x 2     = 2
